      en: ["Northvolt Ett officially commenced commercial production in December 2021.", "The target capacity of 60 GWh makes it one of the largest cell factories in the world.", "The facility employs over 3,000 people from more than 80 different countries.", "The Revolt Ett recycling unit is designed to process 125,000 tons of batteries per year.", "Northvolt has secured supply contracts worth over $50 billion with VW, BMW, and Volvo.", "The industrial footprint of the factory covers approximately 100 hectares of land."],
